  For mistranscriptions you've noticed yourself, edit src/data/corrections.ts — they'll be applied deterministically before any AI call.
  [button "Choose .sbv file"] [file-input accept=".sbv"]
  [summary "Saved chronicles— everything produced so far, and re-forging it." closed] Saved chronicles— everything produced so far, and re-forging it.
  Saved Chronicles
  Every finished run is auto-saved here and kept until you delete it — safe across reloads and restarts. Download what you need, then bin the rest.
  [button "Refresh"]
  [button "Campaign-One — Session 3<datetime> · 1,840 words · gemini · extrasgrounded transcript saved with this runchronicle saved with this run"] [button "Reforge"] [button "Delete chronicle"]
  [button "Campaign-One — Session 2<datetime> · 920 words · openrouter · condensedno grounded transcript saved with this runchronicle saved with this run"] [button "Reforge"] [button "Delete chronicle"]
  Reforge a Chronicle
  Redo extras / condense — or rewrite the chronicle — on a model of your choice. Keeps your original."
`;

